abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for functional dependency screening and calibrated
  transcriptomic inference of trogocytosis-related hypotheses in colorectal
  cancer. It contains portable analysis scripts, processed derivatives,
  quality-control records, source-data tables and final figures.
